Prince: What is Tawheed?

Munir: Tawheed means to single out Allah in lordship, worship, and in the names and attributes He described himself.
Munir: It means that no one else possesses these qualities except Him.

Munir: This means that Allah is the sole Creator, Owner, and Controller of this world.
Munir: That Allah is the only one worthy of being worshipped.
Munir: And that Allah is the only one who has the best names and attributes he described himself with.

